    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User playbook</label><div><h5>Overview</h5><ul><li>Start page with discovery, favorites, to-do, notes, climate, feed.</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: launch command palette</li><li>1-9: launch first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>/ : focus discovery (also via palette)</li><li>Enter in discovery: start discovery</li><li>ESC: close modals</li><li>Palette: fast actions for modules, mode, backdrop, data, favorites</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"rebase header colors\" resets discovery & clock</li></ul><h5>discovery & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Bangs:!g!ddg!bing!yt!wiki!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in config;{q}as placeholder</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts discovery</li></ul><h5>Tiles</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to launch</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>rebase: restore baseline favorites</li></ul><h5>modules & Layout</h5><ul><li>Visibility per module</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Custom colors for clock/discovery; rebase restores style defaults</li><li>module colors & \"Tint modules\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>backdrop</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/mode/interval)</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active backdrop</li></ul><h5>data</h5><ul><li>export/ingest as JSON</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage copilot</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in config).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change modules and config (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>. Execution-ready.",
